  "fullDescription": "Add crisp, expressive texture to your artwork with the Crispy Duo Procreate Brushes. This two-brush set includes Crispy Inker for bold, textured linework and Crumb Coat Fill for adding rich, grainy color with an organic hand-drawn feel.\n\nPerfect for quirky characters, whimsical monsters, animals, mandalas, doodles, comics, coloring pages, and digital illustrations. The inker creates lively, slightly rough outlines while the companion fill brush adds soft textured color that pairs beautifully with every stroke.\n\nIncludes:\n– Crispy Inker\n– Crumb Coat Fill\n\nCompatible with Procreate on iPad.",
